  "description": "Azure Functions Isolated Worker integration for ShiftSoftware.UnifiedAttestation. Provides seamless dependency injection extensions and a custom middleware pipeline with declarative attributes ([ValidateAttestation]) to easily secure serverless endpoints against unauthorized or tampered mobile clients.",
